    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present this delightful 1 bed, 1 bath top (3rd) floor apartment. Boasting sea views towards Ireland Eye from both the living room and bedroom. The block benefits from a secure, gated, communal landscaped courtyard. The apartment is in great condition and has been well maintained throughout, offering bright and spacious accommodation. Ideally suited to first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors alike!\n\nInternally, the apartment is well laid out and offers bright accommodation throughout, with attractive sea views enjoyed from the main living space and bedroom. The property briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall with hot press, a spacious open plan kitchen/dining/living area, a generous double bedroom, and a main bathroom.\n\nThis is a great location within a lovely community neighbourhood with plenty of outdoor communal space for relaxation. The greenway walk and cycle pathway is nearby giving access to Portmarnock/Malahide. The DART station in Clongriffin is a mere 10 minutes' walk and the there is the No. 15 bus on the main road. In addition to local shops and services, there are great sporting facilities in the vicinity and there is easy access to the M1 and M50 motorways and Dublin Airport."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 5.6m x 1.0m\nEntrance hall featuring laminate-effect timber flooring, recessed lighting, and hot press\n\nKitchen - 2.1m x 3.5m\nModern fitted kitchen with integrated appliances including a fridge/freezer, oven, hob, extractor fan, and space for a washing machine and dishwasher. The kitchen features laminate-effect timber flooring and overlooks the garden.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 4.5m x 3.6m\nBright and spacious open plan living room featuring laminate-effect timber flooring and a phone point, seamlessly connecting to the kitchen area. The room further benefits from attractive sea views towards Ireland's Eye.\n\nBedroom - 2.8m x 3.6m\nBright and spacious double bedroom featuring laminate-effect timber flooring and a built-in wardrobe. The room benefits from multiple windows with attractive sea views towards Ireland's Eye.\n\nBathroom - 1.8m x 2.43\nBathroom comprising a WC, wash hand basin, and bathtub with shower. The room is finished with tiled flooring.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>1 Bed, 1 Bath top (3rd) floor apartment</li><li>Double glazed windows</li><li>Gas fired central heating </li><li>Secure communal courtyard</li><li>Designated car space + visitor parking</li><li>Excellent location </li><li>Close proximity to Dublin Airport and M1/M50</li><li>Mgt Fee 2,550 p.a. approx.</li><li>Approx. 45.5 sqm / 490 sqft</ul>"
      },
      {
